Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; ============================================================================
;  Removes the "Compress + OCR (searchable)" .pdf context menu installed by
;  compress-pdf-context-menu.reg.
;
;  The leading "-" on the key name means DELETE THAT KEY AND EVERYTHING UNDER
;  IT. Only this one verb is removed -- the rest of the .pdf association, and
;  any other tool's entries, are untouched. No files are affected.
; ============================================================================

[-HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Classes\SystemFileAssociations\.pdf\shell\CompressPDF]
